一直在扑你的腿，但它是在你身体里面，这更奇怪。

1542
01:23:18.150 --> 01:23:18.530
Yeah.
是啊。

1543
01:23:18.810 --> 01:23:20.010
It's like the alien.
就像异形一样。

1544
01:23:20.010 --> 01:23:20.910
What is happening?
到底发生了什么？

1545
01:23:21.370 --> 01:23:22.410
Women are warriors.
女性是战士。

1546
01:23:22.930 --> 01:23:23.930
Way to go, Ange.
干得好，安吉。

1547
01:23:24.370 --> 01:23:28.650
Beth Grant also shared her memories about shooting this dinner table scene.
贝丝·格兰特也分享了她拍摄这场餐桌戏的回忆。

1548
01:23:28.810 --> 01:23:29.970
Let's have a listen.
我们来听听看。

1549
01:23:30.450 --> 01:23:33.990
Sitting at that table and, you know, sucking on those beets.
坐在那张桌子旁，你知道，吮吸着那些甜菜。

1550
01:23:34.150 --> 01:23:36.990
The reason I was sucking on those beets was to keep from laughing.
我吮吸那些甜菜的原因是为了忍住不笑。

1551
01:23:36.990 --> 01:23:42.930
And Rain's over there eating and going, mm, mm, mm, mm, mm, mm.
雷恩就在那边吃边说，嗯，嗯，嗯，嗯，嗯，嗯。

1552
01:23:43.050 --> 01:23:47.110
There's so much subtle humor in this episode.
这一集里有太多微妙的幽默了。

1553
01:23:47.110 --> 01:23:50.950
And then, of course, the demented relationship that they have.
当然还有他们之间那种疯狂的关系。

1554
01:23:51.090 --> 01:23:52.690
I love you all so much.
我太爱你们所有人了。

1555
01:23:52.750 --> 01:23:57.790
I'm so honored to be part of this very popular and respected episode.
能参与这一集如此受欢迎且备受推崇的剧集，我深感荣幸。

1556
01:23:57.970 --> 01:24:02.910
Each of you doing such beautiful, subtle, hilarious comedy.
你们每个人都贡献了如此精彩、微妙又搞笑的表演。

1557
01:24:02.910 --> 01:24:06.210
